## SQ-LEM-01 | ripe lemon tree: pick 10 times, break 10 times (tree at 135)
@group A
@commands boot; harvest a ripe lemon tree (age 4, lower half), by right-click pick and by breaking, 10 times each; grep `latest.log` for `LemonTreePickYieldMixin`
@pass each pick gives 2 to 5 lemons (rerun after the 2026-11-02 mixin; r1102b gave 1 to 2) and resets the tree to age 2; each break 2 to 5 (more with Fortune); no mixin apply error
@fails `farming/trees #3`, CD `LemonTreePickYieldMixin` (pick), `data/fruitsdelight/loot_tables/blocks/lemon_tree.json` (break)
@from batches/r1102b/s3_A.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
> pbot spawn lem 135 -60 503 minecraft:overworld survival
> pbot hold lem minecraft:air
repeat 10
> setblock 135 -60 500 fruitsdelight:lemon_tree[age=4,half=lower]
> setblock 135 -59 500 fruitsdelight:lemon_tree[age=4,half=upper]
> pbot use lem 135 -60 500 south
> execute if block 135 -60 500 fruitsdelight:lemon_tree[age=2] run say LEM01 reset to age 2
end
sleep 2
> cdevtest items 135 -59 500 5
> clear lem fruitsdelight:lemon 0
count LEM01 reset to age 2 == 10
> clear lem
repeat 10
> setblock 135 -60 500 fruitsdelight:lemon_tree[age=4,half=lower]
> setblock 135 -59 500 fruitsdelight:lemon_tree[age=4,half=upper]
> cdevtest break 135 -60 500
end
count verb=break who=\S+ broken=true before="?fruitsdelight:lemon_tree == 10
count verb=break drops=\S*fruitsdelight:lemon:[2-5]\b == 10
reject verb=\S+ .*done=0
> pbot remove lem
look pick: the verb=items fruitsdelight:lemon count plus the bot's "Found N" = 20 to 50 over 10 picks

